   "why": "Stores never write 'Minis' on the 5-packs ('.35g (5pk) Prerolls', '5pk - 2.5g', '5 x .5g'): readings say line none at p 0.4-0.6 and land in review. As a line, Minis also made line fill infer a 1g on every Minis strain, colliding with each strain's 1g Joint (Citronella, Lotta Lato and Pound Cake 1g joints went to review_near/unsure). The 5-packs differ from the joint by size (1.75g / 2.5g), so they need no line; Minis stays the line only for the 0.5g x 2 = 1g 2-packs (https://weedmaps.com/brands/florette/products)."
